note top of "ores::shell::app::commands::folder_commands"
Registration is not done by the units. =synthetic_entity_commands=, in the
=ores.shell.application= part, is the one name the REPL calls: it walks the
nine units and installs each below its own root menu. Adding an entity
therefore changes the generated part and never the REPL.
end note

